acSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI启动ChatGPT for Academic Researchers计划，向10万名科研人员免费开放高级版服务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta计划推动数十亿用户进入智能体时代，扎克伯格押注个人AI代理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布Lyria 3.5音乐生成模型，强化人声情感与创作控制力</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布2026财年Q4财报：投资Anthropic单季获利32亿美元，OpenAI出现减值</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2ab3ef4ec8c64bb0f52cf5c4949163e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软2026财年第四季度财报显示，其AI投资组合出现显著分化：对Anthropic的投资单季带来32亿美元收益，而对OpenAI的投资则出现约6亿美元减值。微软于2025年11月向Anthropic注资50亿美元，并达成Anthropic采购300亿美元Azure云服务的协议，该笔投资已实现明显账面增长。相比之下，微软持有OpenAI约27%股份，本季度减值导致摊薄后每股收益减少约7美分。尽管如此，OpenAI投资在2026财年全年仍贡献了50亿美元收益，推动全年每股收益增加67美分。微软本季度整体营收达900亿美元，净利润358亿美元。此次财报披露折射出微软双线AI投资策略的动态变化，Anthropic在账面表现上已展现出强劲的增长潜力，对行业而言，这标志着微软在头部大模型厂商间的资源配置与回报预期正进入新的</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Waymo发布专用自动驾驶网约车Ojai，深度整合Gemini AI与三屏协同系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/254a7fe602bd869506e673d4e8f716b0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet旗下Waymo正式发布专为共享出行设计的自动驾驶网约车Ojai，该车型实现车载界面重大改版，并深度集成Gemini in Waymo AI助手。乘客可通过语音或屏幕进行空调调节、知识查询及靠边停车指令下达。为保障安全，Gemini系统与底层Waymo Driver驾驶系统物理隔离，无法直接控制车辆移动或获取实时驾驶数据。硬件方面，Ojai配备三块智能屏幕，可根据乘客座位位置分发差异化内容，后排主座拥有完整车控权限。此外，系统新增“Calm Mode”静谧模式，通过自动调暗屏幕及隐藏非必要元素，提升乘车舒适度。此次更新标志着Waymo在自动驾驶座舱交互体验上的重要升级，通过AI与硬件协同，进一步优化了共享出行的智能化与个性化服务水平。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI启动ChatGPT for Academic Researchers计划，向10万名科研人员免费开放高级版服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/63f4eddfb774eabf2eeaf18d0912444d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式启动“ChatGPT for Academic Researchers”计划，旨在为科研人员提供更强大的AI技术支持。该计划初期面向部分高校的1万名科研人员开放，未来将逐步扩大至10万名。入选的科研人员可获得使用次数限制更高、上下文窗口更大的高级版ChatGPT，且每位参与者可额外邀请本机构的四位同事共享同等权益。此外，OpenAI计划推出扩展版聊天机器人深度研究功能，支持研究人员从科学期刊等特定资源中更高效地洞察课题。此举将显著提升学术界利用LLM进行科研分析的效率，通过提供更深度的技术工具，助力科研人员在复杂课题研究中获取更精准的洞察，推动AI技术在学术领域的深度应用与落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta计划推动数十亿用户进入智能体时代，扎克伯格押注个人AI代理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/24d89f46d98eebd61dd14a8254fff6bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta创始人兼CEO马克·扎克伯格在最新财报会议上宣布，公司正全力布局个人AI代理，旨在未来五年内让数十亿用户通过AI处理财务、健康及家庭管理等复杂事务。Meta计划将WhatsApp等即时通讯平台作为AI Agent的核心入口，目前已有超100万家企业在WhatsApp和Messenger上使用AI代理服务。为支撑AI基础设施需求，Meta与贝莱德合作投资约140亿美元在德克萨斯州建设数据中心。尽管Reality Labs部门本季度亏损约46亿美元，且自由现金流同比下降约91%，扎克伯格仍坚持认为AI产品与智能服务具备更高利润潜力。行业竞争正从传统聊天机器人转向能够代表用户执行任务的Agent体系，Meta正通过强化AI基础设施与产品生态，试图将AI代理打造为下一阶段的核心增长引擎。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布Lyria 3.5音乐生成模型，强化人声情感与创作控制力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6e78e8366f490706b760c53ba4ae693d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind正式在Google Flow Music平台推出新一代音乐生成模型Lyria 3.5。此次升级重点提升了音乐性、歌词质量、人声表现力及创作控制力。在技术层面，Lyria 3.5能够构建更复杂且自然的旋律织体，其歌词生成模块增强了对提示词的语义理解与结构意识，确保词作与曲风高度契合。在人声表现上，新模型输出的歌声具备更强的情感张力与清晰度，显著提升了成品感染力。此外，Lyria 3.5优化了交互体验，创作者可更精准地调整输出内容的节奏与时长，实现高效的个性化音乐创作。此次更新标志着AI音乐生成技术在专业应用场景的进一步落地，为创作者提供了更具掌控力的创作工具。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
